abstract: "Frozen evidence and bounded reproducibility workflows for annotation-versus-sequence disagreement in a selected 507-genome collection. The earliest global BLASTP invocation has not been recovered. No candidate activity is established. Project code is MIT; author-owned documentation/results are CC BY 4.0; third-party file/record exclusions are specified in LICENSE.md."
